  "steps": [
    "Soak the moong dal in water for 1 hour until softened but still crunchy, then drain completely.",
    "Combine the dal, cucumber, carrot, coconut and green chilli in a bowl.",
    "Heat the oil in a small pan, crackle the mustard seeds and add the curry leaves.",
    "Pour the tempering over the salad.",
    "Add salt, lemon juice and coriander leaves, and toss lightly just before serving."
  ]
